one, what we are doing

00:31:14.820 --> 00:31:17.490
is we are taking
like the modulo--

00:31:17.490 --> 00:31:20.250
sorry, not modulo, the integer
division with frequency

00:31:20.250 --> 00:31:25.070
s and then multiplied by
