ps at each whenever

00:31:50.760 --> 00:31:52.125
the symbol s is being encoded.

00:31:58.200 --> 00:31:58.700
Yeah.

00:31:58.700 --> 00:32:03.180
And so let's just
focus on this step now.

00:32:03.180 --> 00:32:04.060
Let's see.

00:32:04.060 --> 00:32:07.410
Let's work it out together
for a few examples so

00:32:07.410 --> 00:32:09.960
