what just happened.

00:32:09.960 --> 00:32:15.240
So this-- again, I'm repeating
because I like to remember it.

00:32:15.240 --> 00:32:17.610
Like this base step, it's
always good to go back

00:32:17.610 --> 00:32:21.330
