00:32:21.330 --> 00:32:28.380
So previously, it was x
previous times 10 plus symbol.

00:32:28.380 --> 00:32:31.830
And so now this 10
part, let's take--

00:32:31.830 --> 00:32:34.680
this 10 part is being replaced
by something like this,

00:32:34.680 --> 00:32:36.840
and this plus symbol
part has been replaced

00:32:36.840 --> 00:32:37.950
